      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 лет назад",
      "rating": 1,
      "text": {
        "text": "They are using very old treatment methods and forbidden medicines in most of the countries. Nevena Đuričić is rude and  ignorant. When I asked few questions about the procedure of the treatment; she said “if you don’t like, you can go to your country”.  I left my treatment in the middle and I found a new dentist. And we learned that the treatment she did until now was completely unsuccessful. She tried to do the canal treatment without finding the nerves!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
